# What is Project Based Learning (PBL)?

#### **Project Based Learning** is an instructional approach where students learn by actively working on a meaningful project over time. Instead of learning concepts first and applying them later, students build understanding as they investigate a compelling question and create a final product.

#### In PBL, learning is a process of inquiry, feedback, and revision that leads to a final product similar to what industry professional might generate, just at an age-appropriate level!

